.TITLE "powershell"

.DIV "DESCRIPTION"
A cross-platform task automation solution made up of a command-line shell and a scripting language. It provides comprehensive control over the __Windows environment__.

.DIV "ALIAS"

.DIV "TLDR"
**powershell**
Starts a new PowerShell session in the current terminal.
> 

**powershell -Command "Get-Process"**
Executes the specified command and then exits.
> __-Command__ execution flag

**powershell -File script.ps1**
Runs the specified PowerShell script file.
> __-File__ script flag

**powershell -NoProfile**
Starts a session without loading the user's profile scripts.
> __-NoProfile__ clean session flag

**powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File script.ps1**
Runs a script while temporarily bypassing the execution policy.
> __-ExecutionPolicy__ policy flag

.DIV "SUMMARY"
PowerShell is highly extensible and integrates deeply with the .NET framework. Use the __-NoProfile__ flag when running scripts in automated environments to ensure a consistent execution state.

.DIV "SEE ALSO"
**windows:wsl** **windows:cmd**

